DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261023
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261024
SUMMARY:Deadline: World of Art / SCCA-Ljubljana: Award for Curatorial Pract
 ices 2026
DESCRIPTION:To mark the 30th anniversary of its World of Art school for cur
 atorial practices and writing\, SCCA-Ljubljana establishes the Award for C
 uratorial Practices\, recognizing outstanding achievements in curating con
 temporary visual art.\n\nOrganisation: World of Art School\, SCCA-Ljubljan
 a\, with Moderna galerija (MG+MSUM)\, Cukrarna/MGML and Center for Contemp
 orary Arts Celje\nLocation: Ljubljana\, Slovenia. For curators working in 
 Slovenia's cultural sector\, or Slovenian curators realizing projects in i
 nternational institutions.\nAward: Two cash awards: a Large Award of EUR 5
 \,000 gross (minimum 10 completed projects in the last 15 years) and a Sma
 ll Award of EUR 2\,500 gross (minimum 3 completed projects in the last 5 y
 ears). No application fee.\nDuration: One-time award\; ceremony in Decembe
 r 2026.\n\nMore: https://www.worldofart.org/en/award-for-curatorial-practi
 ces-2026-open-call/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=refer
 ral
URL:https://www.worldofart.org/en/award-for-curatorial-practices-2026-open-
 call/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Ljubljana\, Slovenia. For curators working in Slovenia's cultural 
 sector\, or Slovenian curators realizing projects in international institu
 tions.
END:VEVENT
