UID:alkazi-curatorial-research-fellowship-2027@artificialnouveau.github.io
DTSTAMP:20261104T162449Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261107
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261108
SUMMARY:Deadline: Alkazi Foundation: Curatorial Research Fellowship 2027 (w
 ith CWIT and the V&A)
DESCRIPTION:A funded research residency (3rd edition of the Visiting Curato
 rial Research Fellowship) for mid-career cultural producers from India: ar
 tists\, scholars\, writers/editors and curators pursuing humanities-driven
  research in the V&A's global photography and visual-culture collections i
 n London. The awardee is announced in February 2027 and the fellowship sta
 rts April 2027.\n\nOrganisation: Alkazi Foundation for the Arts\, with the
  Charles Wallace India Trust and the Victoria and Albert Museum\nLocation:
  New Delhi\, India (organiser)\; the funded research residency takes place
  at the V&A Photography Section\, London. RESTRICTED: Indian citizens domi
 ciled in India\, aged 25 to 45\, mid-career.\nAward: GBP 1\,600 monthly st
 ipend for 3 to 6 months\, plus a GBP 800 contribution from CWIT towards in
 ternational return airfare\; visa expenses covered by the Alkazi Foundatio
 n. No application fee.\nDuration: 3 to 6 months\n\nMore: https://alkazifou
 ndation.org/call-for-entries-5/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_
 medium=referral
URL:https://alkazifoundation.org/call-for-entries-5/?utm_source=artificialn
 ouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:New Delhi\, India (organiser)\; the funded research residency take
 s place at the V&A Photography Section\, London. RESTRICTED: Indian citize
 ns domiciled in India\, aged 25 to 45\, mid-career.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:visarts-emerging-curator-program-2027@artificialnouveau.github.io
DTSTAMP:20261104T162449Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261218
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261219
SUMMARY:Deadline: VisArts: Emerging Curator Program 2027 (Rockville\, Maryl
 and)
DESCRIPTION:VisArts\, a nonprofit arts center in Rockville\, Maryland\, pai
 rs one emerging curator with mentoring curator Fabiola R. Delgado for a ye
 ar-long program culminating in an exhibition at the Kaplan Gallery. WHAT Y
 OU GET: a USD 10\,000 budget covering exhibition costs and curatorial fees
 \, year-long mentorship\, and staff support for printing\, promotions and 
 exhibition programming.\n\nOrganisation: VisArts\nLocation: VisArts\, Rock
 ville Town Square\, Rockville\, Maryland\, USA. International applicants m
 ust already be eligible to work in the United States (no visa assistance).
 \nAward: USD 10\,000 budget covering exhibition costs and curatorial fees\
 , plus a year of mentorship and staff support for printing\, promotion and
  programming. No application fee.\nDuration: One year\, beginning January 
 2027\; the Emerging Curator's exhibition runs 15 October 2027 to 9 January
  2028 in the Kaplan Gallery.\n\nMore: https://visarts.submittable.com/subm
 it/369990/emerging-curator-program-2027?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantd
 esk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://visarts.submittable.com/submit/369990/emerging-curator-program-
 2027?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:VisArts\, Rockville Town Square\, Rockville\, Maryland\, USA. Inte
 rnational applicants must already be eligible to work in the United States
  (no visa assistance).
END:VEVENT
