SUMMARY:Deadline: Asian Cultural Council Organization Grant 2027 (up to USD
  50\,000)
DESCRIPTION:The Asian Cultural Council's Organization Grant funds arts and 
 culture organisations to send participants on cultural exchange between th
 e US and Asia or within Asia. SUPPORT: up to USD 50\,000.\n\nOrganisation:
  Asian Cultural Council\nLocation: Cultural exchange travel between the US
  and Asia\, or within Asia. For nonprofit\, government-affiliated or acade
 mic organisations registered in ACC-eligible locations.\nAward: Up to USD 
 50\,000 per organisation for exchange travel by its participants. No appli
 cation fee.\nDuration: 1 to 6 months of travel (at least 30 consecutive da
 ys in the US\, or 30 cumulative days in Asia)\, with activities between 1 
 August 2027 and 31 December 2028\n\nMore: https://www.asianculturalcouncil
 .org/grant-opportunities?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=
 referral
